    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Role in neonatal HSV:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " start acyclovir STAT and presumptively in sus cases; disseminated and/or CNS dz: acyclovir for 21 days; localized dz (skin, mouth, conjunctivae): acyclovir for 14 days; then PO acyclovir for 6 mo for any form (better neurodevelopment @ 1 y; may cause neutropenia)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "preg w genital herpes: acyclovir from 36 wks gestation ↓ recurr and the need for C-section; immunocompromised, CNS infect or neonatal herpes: IV acyclovir;"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Safety:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " acyclovir AEs: phlebitis, renal dysfun, rarely neurotoxicity (lethargy, confusion, sz, coma; USU w renal insuff); acyclovir-resistant strains are also resistant to penciclovir, famciclovir and valacyclovir; foscarnet may be effective."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "CI: hypersensitivity to valacyclovir, acyclovir or any component."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
